Hey, come inside, I'll warm you up.

391
00:35:09,959 --> 00:35:13,179
今までよく頑張ったね
You've tried so hard until now.

392
00:35:13,179 --> 00:35:16,259
ここらで休んでみませんか
How about resting here for a bit?

393
00:35:16,259 --> 00:35:18,579
ゆっくり話をしませんか
How about taking our time to talk?

394
00:35:30,279 --> 00:35:33,479
足跡は雪が消していた
The footprints had been erased by the snow.

395
00:35:33,479 --> 00:35:35,539
声はひどく痛んだ
Your voice was terribly sore.

396
00:35:35,539 --> 00:35:37,459
乾いた 乾いた
Thirsty, thirsty...

397
00:35:37,459 --> 00:35:40,979
遠くの狐がこんこんと 僕たちを探しているようだ
The far-off fox is howling, searching for us.

398
00:35:40,979 --> 00:35:42,559
そっと息を潜めた
Quietly holding my breath.

399
00:35:42,559 --> 00:35:46,379
このままこのまま行こうか 凍てつく雪の中で
Just like this, let's keep going into the freezing snow.

400
00:35:46,379 --> 00:35:49,079
確かな熱を帯びた
Embracing a definite warmth.

401
00:35:49,079 --> 00:35:52,259
呼吸をして声を焼いて 燃えた燃えた竈の火
Breathing and burning our voices, the fire burns bright.

402
00:35:52,259 --> 00:35:55,279
さぁ縁の坦根を超えて 貴方をもっと知りたい
Now, crossing the fences of fate, I want to know you more.

403
00:35:55,279 --> 00:35:58,379
