460
00:40:53,064 --> 00:40:56,864
滔々と流れていく風景
The scenery flowing on endlessly,

461
00:40:57,064 --> 00:41:03,564
刹那的な日々の中で
amidst these fleeting days.

462
00:41:04,264 --> 00:41:08,064
差し伸べられた手は優しく
The hand extended to me so gently

463
00:41:08,564 --> 00:41:13,564
鼓動に浸る微熱の予感
brims with a slight fever of anticipation.

464
00:41:14,064 --> 00:41:16,564
風に逆らう
Defying the wind,

465
00:41:17,064 --> 00:41:19,564
そう生きてきたから
because that's how I've lived,

466
00:41:19,864 --> 00:41:22,564
君に会って気付く
meeting you made me realize

467
